       the suffix key wins, and the un-suffixed key below is the fallback,
       so the base key stays "mining" and no _Mining entry is needed.
       NOTE: these sentences must NOT interpolate a code-supplied Chinese word
       (only the keyed text itself is language-specific), so where the Chinese
       file takes a worker-supplied argument this file simply omits the placeholder. -->
